translate schinese_rewrite main_sundersilk_cascades_0a4771fd:

    # "In the peripheral of your vision, you discover a young sprout wiggling around the waterfall."
    "在你的余光中，你发现一株幼芽在瀑布边扭动着。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_sundersilk_cascades_3641f075:

    # "Perhaps it's what you believe to be the eversprout Gwyddyon's scroll talked about..."
    "或许，这就是格威迪恩的卷轴里提到的永生芽……"

translate schinese_rewrite main_sundersilk_cascades_40514641:

    # "You reach out and grab onto the herb, but the deceitful sprout jumps away as you reach out for it, bouncing its way out of your sight."
    "你伸手抓住那株草药，但狡猾的幼芽在你伸手时跳开了，一路弹跳着消失在你的视线中。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_sundersilk_cascades_afe910c8:

    # e "Wait, where did it go..."
    e "等等，它跑哪儿去了……"

translate schinese_rewrite main_sundersilk_cascades_5ad7ac97:

    # "The sprout must be close, you should chase after it before it disappears once more."
    "幼芽一定就在附近；你应该趁它再次消失前追上去。"

translate schinese_rewrite sundersilk_cascades_loop_e91ba75d:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你找了又找，但周围似乎没有什么值得关注的东西了。"

translate schinese_rewrite sundersilk_cascades_loop_61427a96:

    # "You look around the sundersilk cascades, under the bright sun you see some shiny blue flowers near the waterfall, you went and pick it up. It was a Hydrangea."
    "你漫步剪绸瀑布，注意到艳阳下一丛亮蓝色的花朵开在瀑布旁边，你走近采下了一束。原来这是绣球花。"

translate schinese_rewrite sundersilk_cascades_loop_6e7cd034:

    # "You put it in your bag, you now have [item_number] hydrangea."
    "你将绣球花放进背包，现在你持有 [item_number] 束绣球花。"

translate schinese_rewrite sundersilk_cascades_loop_2247b841:

    # "You look around the sundersilk cascades, under the bright sun you see a fluffy feather between the grass, you went and pick it up. It was a feather."
    "你漫步剪绸瀑布，注意到艳阳下一根羽毛静静躺在草地上，你走近将它捡了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite sundersilk_cascades_loop_12f65c80:

    # "You put it in your bag, you now have [item_number] feather."
    "你将羽毛放进背包，现在你持有 [item_number] 根羽毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite sundersilk_cascades_loop_01c69582:

    # "You put it in your bag, you now have [item_number] feathers."
    "你将羽毛放进背包，现在你持有 [item_number] 根羽毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite sundersilk_cascades_loop_e91ba75d_1:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你找了又找，但周围似乎没有什么值得关注的东西了。"

translate schinese_rewrite sundersilk_cascades_loop_e91ba75d_2:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你找了又找，但周围似乎没有什么值得关注的东西了。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_grove_of_harvest_83748d4a:

    # "You walk slowly towards the bushes, and suddenly you see a tall vine-like creature peeking out from the bushes."
    "你慢慢走向灌木丛，突然看见一只高大的藤蔓状生物从灌木丛中探出头来。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_grove_of_harvest_b2e2d8aa:

    # "With a rustle of leaves, the Seedsman bursts from a wall of brambles. His thorn-laced arms snap outward, vines writhing like serpents."
    "伴着树叶沙沙作响，种子人从一面荆棘丛中冲了出来。他那缠着荆棘的双臂猛地张开，藤蔓像蛇一样扭动着。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_grove_of_harvest_cef234a5:

    # e "S-shit!"
    e "糟、糟糕！"

translate schinese_rewrite grove_of_harvest_loop_0979e692:

    # "Around the garden, you wander and pick up a certain fruit, it was a Hawthorn."
    "你在花园里四处闲逛，随手摘下一种果实。原来是山楂。"

translate schinese_rewrite grove_of_harvest_loop_f1247855:

    # "You put the Hawthorn in your bag, you now have [item_number] Hawthorn."
    "你把山楂放进背包，现在你有 [item_number] 颗山楂。"

translate schinese_rewrite grove_of_harvest_loop_6c7128d1:

    # "You put the Hawthorn in your bag, you now have [item_number] Hawthorns."
    "你把山楂放进背包，现在你有 [item_number] 颗山楂。"

translate schinese_rewrite grove_of_harvest_loop_d2418219:

    # "Around the garden, you notice that there's row of apple bushes nearby, you go and pick one of them up."
    "你在花园里注意到附近有一排苹果灌木，于是走过去摘了一个。"

translate schinese_rewrite grove_of_harvest_loop_6352028d:

    # "You put the Apple in your bag, you now have [item_number] Apple."
    "你把苹果放进背包，现在你有 [item_number] 个苹果。"

translate schinese_rewrite grove_of_harvest_loop_b0c80c66:

    # "You put the Apple in your bag, you now have [item_number] Apples."
    "你把苹果放进背包，现在你有 [item_number] 个苹果。"

translate schinese_rewrite grove_of_harvest_loop_adbfa3ee:

    # "Around the garden, you wander and pick up a certain flower, it was a red rose."
    "你在花园里四处闲逛，摘下一朵花。原来是红玫瑰。"

translate schinese_rewrite grove_of_harvest_loop_951f9bfc:

    # "You put it in your bag, you now have [item_number] rose."
    "你把它放进背包，现在你有 [item_number] 朵玫瑰。"

translate schinese_rewrite grove_of_harvest_loop_e21c776a:

    # "You put it in your bag, you now have [item_number] roses."
    "你把它放进背包，现在你有 [item_number] 朵玫瑰。"

translate schinese_rewrite grove_of_harvest_loop_0acccf7f:

    # "You run into a scarecrow on the field, it seems to not be aware of your presence."
    "你在田野里撞见一个稻草人，它似乎没有察觉到你的存在。"

translate schinese_rewrite grove_of_harvest_loop_e91ba75d:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你找了又找，但周围似乎没有什么值得关注的东西了。"

translate schinese_rewrite grove_of_harvest_loop_8e3600a1:

    # "As you walk around the garden, you notice a wide path that leads to outside of the village, you follow the path, and soon, you find yourself in the middle of a meadow."
    "你在花园里走着，注意到一条通往村外的宽阔小路。你沿路走去，不久便来到一片草甸中央。"

translate schinese_rewrite grove_of_harvest_loop_c29fc376:

    # "It looks like you are now at the Prattlefell Meadow."
    "看来你现在在碎语草甸。"

translate schinese_rewrite grove_of_harvest_loop_61809dfa:

    # "You walk around the garden, and you notice a small patch of flowers nearby, you go and pick it up, it was hops."
    "你在花园里走着，注意到附近有一小片花丛，于是走过去采了一些。原来是啤酒花。"

translate schinese_rewrite grove_of_harvest_loop_c729f9ed:

    # "You put the flower in your bag, you now have [item_number] hops."
    "你把花放进背包，现在你有 [item_number] 份啤酒花。"

translate schinese_rewrite grove_of_harvest_loop_c729f9ed_1:

    # "You put the flower in your bag, you now have [item_number] hops."
    "你把花放进背包，现在你有 [item_number] 份啤酒花。"

translate schinese_rewrite grove_of_harvest_loop_e91ba75d_1:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你找了又找，但周围似乎没有什么值得关注的东西了。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_7d8da235:

    # e "P-pirkka?"
    e "皮、皮尔卡？"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_ac31f661:

    # "The wandering bard is sitting by a campfire, strumming his lute."
    "流浪的吟游诗人正坐在篝火旁，弹奏着鲁特琴。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_cb981e3e:

    # "He looks up and smiles as you approach."
    "你走近时，他抬起头，朝你微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_bb776f31:

    # p "[e], my friend. It's good to see you again. I hope your journey was successful? Please tell me you do."
    p "[e]，我的朋友。很高兴再次见到你。希望你的旅程顺利？快告诉我，顺利吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_27f83d51:

    # e "About that, I'm sorry, Pirk. I didn't find the prose, but I did find some clues about where it might be."
    e "关于这个，我很抱歉，皮尔卡。我没找到诗文，但确实找到了一些线索，能指向它可能所在的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_a526b1eb:

    # e "They sold it to someone else in the village, I suppose it's Lusterfield?"
    e "他们把它卖给了村子里其他人 我猜是乐斯民菲尔德?"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_e91ba75d:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你找了又找，但周围似乎没有什么值得关注的东西了。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_b50c6954:

    # "Suddenly, you find a gnoll jumping out from the tall grass."
    "突然，你发现一只豺狼人从高高的草丛中跳了出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_74bcfd4b:

    # "You found a small piece of paper that details the recipe for a... stylistic hat that is usually worn by a famous bard."
    "你找到一小张纸，上面写着一种……风格独特的帽子的配方，这种帽子通常由一位著名吟游诗人佩戴。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_e48a4c2e:

    # "As you walk around the meadow, a faint grey building can be seen amongst the green grassland, white flags and cloth hanging around the building with a tint of red."
    "你在草甸上走着，绿草间隐约可见一座灰色建筑；建筑周围悬挂着白旗和布幔，染着一抹红色。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_5d9ab011:

    # "You can see a few bandits walking around the area, seem to be guarding the area."
    "你看见几名强盗在附近走动，似乎是在看守这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_ad065d54:

    # "You approach the building with caution, and soon, you find yourself in front of the bandit's hideout."
    "你谨慎地走近那栋建筑，不久便来到强盗藏身处前。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_008c6f87:

    # "Half-buried beneath the roots of a tall grass, you uncover a weathered note sealed in wax."
    "高草的根部下方半埋着一张饱经风霜的纸条，你把它挖了出来；纸条用蜡封着。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_6927fe4c:

    # "It details how to craft a knight helmet from 3 iron ingots, 1 strap, and 1 piece of fabric."
    "纸条上写着骑士头盔的制作方法：3块铁锭、1条带子和1块布料。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_c7cee043:

    # "The note seems to be quite old, and the ink is smudged in some areas, but you can still make out the instructions clearly enough."
    "纸条看起来已经相当老旧，有些地方的墨迹也洇开了，但你仍能基本看清上面的说明。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_81726faa:

    # msg "You have learnt the recipe for Knight Helmet."
    msg "你学会了骑士头盔的配方。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_e1489f9c:

    # "You walk around the meadow, and you notice a small patch of flowers nearby, you go and pick it up, it was a mugwort."
    "你在草甸上走着，注意到附近有一小片花丛，于是走过去采了一些。原来是艾草。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_67b5ec95:

    # "You put the flower in your bag, you now have [item_number] mugwort."
    "你把花放进背包，现在你有 [item_number] 份艾草。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_75d1682c:

    # "You put the flower in your bag, you now have [item_number] mugworts."
    "你把花放进背包，现在你有 [item_number] 份艾草。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_cc352da1:

    # "You look around the meadow, under the bright sun you see something tinted red in the bush, you went and pick it up. It was a red berry."
    "你环顾草甸，看到阳光下灌木丛里有东西泛着红色，便走过去将它捡了起来。原来是一颗红莓。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_b7844f3f:

    # "You put the berry in your bag, you now have [item_number] red berry."
    "你把红莓放进背包，现在你有 [item_number] 颗红莓。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_7fafc21e:

    # "You put the berry in your bag, you now have [item_number] red berries."
    "你把红莓放进背包，现在你有 [item_number] 颗红莓。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_9bfbaa46:

    # "You look around the meadow, under the bright sun you see something tinted blue in the bush, you went and pick it up. It was a blue berry."
    "你环顾草甸，看到阳光下灌木丛里有东西泛着蓝色，便走过去将它捡了起来。原来是一颗蓝莓。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_2ec8f616:

    # "You put the berry in your bag, you now have [item_number] blue berry."
    "你把蓝莓放进背包，现在你有 [item_number] 颗蓝莓。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_67284141:

    # "You put the berry in your bag, you now have [item_number] blue berries."
    "你把蓝莓放进背包，现在你有 [item_number] 颗蓝莓。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_379d7be9:

    # "The sunlight glistens off a dirt trail in the meadow, you follow the path, and soon, you find yourself climbing a small hill."
    "阳光照亮草甸上的土路。你沿着小路走去，不久便开始爬上一座小山。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_fa1fdfb9:

    # "At the top of the small hills, you turn back and see a wide view of the meadow, the sun shining down on the grassland, a few trees scattered around the area."
    "登上小山顶后，你回头望去，草甸的广阔景色尽收眼底；阳光洒在草地上，四周零星分布着几棵树。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_48aa34be:

    # "In front of you, it was another vast expanse of plains, with a few spear-shaped rocks sticking out of the ground."
    "你面前又是一片辽阔的平原，地面上突兀地伸出几块长矛形状的岩石。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_871eb842:

    # "And at the horizon, you can see a giant axe-shaped rock piercing the sky, its stature looming over the landscape."
    "地平线上，一块巨大的斧形岩石刺入天空，巍峨的身影俯视着整片景色。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_65a26318:

    # "You search around the area, there seem to be something ahead of you, but it seems like your level is too low to notice it yet."
    "你在附近搜索，似乎前方有什么东西，但你的等级太低，还无法察觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_ce7fce2b:

    # "You walk around the meadow, and suddenly, you notice a small pamphlet lying between the grass."
    "你在草甸上走着，突然注意到草丛间躺着一张小传单。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_694b134f:

    # "It looks to be the same flyer for the travelling carnival, so you quickly put it away."
    "看起来是同一张巡回马戏团传单，所以你赶紧把它收了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_d1949c0b:

    # "Picking it up, it looks to be a flyer for a travelling carnival, putting it in the back, perhaps you should check it out sometime..."
    "你捡起传单，发现这是巡回马戏团的广告；把它收好后，你想着，也许哪天该去看看……"

translate schinese_rewrite prattlefell_meadow_loop_e91ba75d_1:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你找了又找，但周围似乎没有什么值得关注的东西了。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_bandits_hideout_1ad660cd:

    # "You walk outside of the bandit's hall. The one guarding the pathway winks at you before letting you go."
    "你走出强盗大厅。守在通道边的那个人冲你眨了眨眼，才放你离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_bandits_hideout_bab1030c:

    # "You enter the bandit's hideout."
    "你进入强盗藏身处。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_bandits_hideout_205634f3:

    # bd "You can go now, if that wasn't obvious enough."
    bd "现在你可以走了，这还不够明显吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_bandits_hideout_bb46e3d3:

    # "Bandit crosses his arms, and begins to look the other directions."
    "强盗抱起双臂，开始望向别的方向。"

translate schinese_rewrite spearhead_plateau_loop_65a26318:

    # "You search around the area, there seem to be something ahead of you, but it seems like your level is too low to notice it yet."
    "你在附近搜索，似乎前方有什么东西，但你的等级太低，还无法察觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite spearhead_plateau_loop_ce7fce2b:

    # "You walk around the meadow, and suddenly, you notice a small pamphlet lying between the grass."
    "你在草甸上走着，突然注意到草丛间躺着一张小传单。"

translate schinese_rewrite spearhead_plateau_loop_694b134f:

    # "It looks to be the same flyer for the travelling carnival, so you quickly put it away."
    "看起来是同一张巡回马戏团传单，所以你赶紧把它收了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite spearhead_plateau_loop_d1949c0b:

    # "Picking it up, it looks to be a flyer for a travelling carnival, putting it in the back, perhaps you should check it out sometime..."
    "你捡起传单，发现这是巡回马戏团的广告；把它收好后，你想着，也许哪天该去看看……"

translate schinese_rewrite spearhead_plateau_loop_9d14108b:

    # "Near one of the spear-like stones, you find a stitched pattern pinned beneath an old rock."
    "在一块长矛形状的岩石附近，你发现一张缝制图样，被一块旧石头压在下面。"

translate schinese_rewrite spearhead_plateau_loop_7e8d4fd4:

    # "The diagram describes an enchanted kirtle, it's woven from 3 pieces of soft fur, 2 fabrics, and 2 crystal strings."
    "图样描述了一件附魔外衣：由3块柔软的毛皮、2块布料和2根水晶丝线织成。"

translate schinese_rewrite spearhead_plateau_loop_74ea8e81:

    # msg "You have learnt the recipe for Enchanted Kirtle."
    msg "你学会了附魔外衣的配方。"

translate schinese_rewrite spearhead_plateau_loop_168bb671:

    # "As you walk around the plateau, you hear a loud commotion coming from somewhere afar."
    "你在高原上走着，听见远处某处传来一阵喧闹声。"

translate schinese_rewrite spearhead_plateau_loop_a57ac476:

    # "Following the noise, you soon find yourself at a large open field, where a few tents and stalls have been set up."
    "你循声而去，不久便来到一片开阔的大场地，那里已经搭起了几顶帐篷和几处摊位。"

translate schinese_rewrite spearhead_plateau_loop_b67d4a6a:

    # "It seems like the travelling carousal is here."
    "看来巡回旋转木马就在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite spearhead_plateau_loop_e91ba75d:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你找了又找，但周围似乎没有什么值得关注的东西了。"

translate schinese_rewrite travelling_carousal_loop_e91ba75d:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你找了又找，但周围似乎没有什么值得关注的东西了。"

translate schinese_rewrite travelling_carousal_chop_5a88aacf:

    # "A painted stall stands off to the side of the midway, ringed with cut wood, and a small cheering crowd."
    "一处彩绘摊位立在场地一侧，周围围着一圈劈好的木头，还有一小群欢呼的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite travelling_carousal_chop_1997c8b0:

    # "At the center, a bright placard promises ten clean chops in a row for the grand prize of an enchanted chaperon."
    "中央一块醒目的牌子上写着：连续砍中十次，即可赢得大奖——一顶附魔风帽。"

translate schinese_rewrite travelling_carousal_chop_d5099233:

    # "The chaperon itself is gone now, but the barker is still taking challengers to earn 120 gold."
    "附魔风帽现在已经不在了，但叫卖人仍在接受挑战，获胜者可赚得120金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite travelling_carousal_chop_477a6771:

    # barker "Fifty gold a round! One miss and yer out! Fancy your chances?" nointeract
    barker "一轮五十金币！失手一次就出局！敢不敢来试试？"

translate schinese_rewrite travelling_carousal_chop_d536e9f6:

    # "The stallmaster raises his voice to draw more of the crowd over."
    "摊主提高嗓门，吸引更多人群过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite travelling_carousal_chop_3a6a93eb:

    # barker "Step up, young man! Ten perfect chops! Don't blink!"
    barker "来吧，年轻人！连续砍中十次！可别眨眼！"

translate schinese_rewrite travelling_carousal_chop_ac5c002f:

    # "You hear a pounding applause on the wood rails as the last strike lands perfectly."
    "最后一击精准落下，木栏边响起一阵雷鸣般的掌声。"

translate schinese_rewrite travelling_carousal_chop_2d52c335:

    # "Laughing in disbelief, the stallmaster unhooks the enchanted chaperon from its display frame and hands it over as your prize."
    "摊主难以置信地笑着，从展示架上取下附魔风帽，递给你作为奖品。"

translate schinese_rewrite travelling_carousal_chop_e6aa6a3a:

    # barker "Well I'll be! A perfect run! You sure you ain't got some magic in those arms, young man?"
    barker "哎呀，真没想到！一轮完美表现！年轻人，你这双胳膊里该不会真藏着什么魔法吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite travelling_carousal_chop_33c28fac:

    # barker "The grand prize has already been claimed, but your perfect run is still impressive!"
    barker "大奖已经被人赢走了，但你这一轮完美表现依然令人印象深刻！"

translate schinese_rewrite travelling_carousal_chop_742ea384:

    # barker "Here's 120 gold for the show!"
    barker "这是表演奖励的120金币！"

translate schinese_rewrite travelling_carousal_chop_4660c78b:

    # "A miss draws a loud groan from the spectators before the barker claps and waves the next challenger closer."
    "一次失误引来观众一阵响亮的叹息，叫卖人拍着手，把下一位挑战者招呼过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite travelling_carousal_chop_f4b9981b:

    # "You still managed [chopped_wood] clean chops before the round ended."
    "这一轮结束前，你还是干净利落地砍中了 [chopped_wood] 次。"

translate schinese_rewrite travelling_carousal_chop_5f3882b2:

    # "Your round ends before you can build any momentum at all."
    "你还没来得及积起任何气势，这一轮就结束了。"

translate schinese_rewrite travelling_carousal_chop_b036a8dd:

    # "The stallmaster shrugs and immediately turns to shout at another passerby, trying to lure them in instead."
    "摊主耸耸肩，立刻转身朝另一名路人喊话，试图把对方吸引过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Toll_Collect_01fc2cf8:

    # "A gruff voice calls out as you stand in front of the stone structure."
    "你站在石头建筑前时，一个粗哑的声音传了出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Toll_Collect_9bbb5037:

    # bd "Well, well, what do we have here? A traveler, eh?"
    bd "哟，哟，看看这是谁？一位旅行者，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Toll_Collect_49cfe7d7:

    # e "Hey! Back off, I've got weapons."
    e "嘿！退后，我可是有武器的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Toll_Collect_bf5d361c:

    # bd "You've got guts, I'll give you that. But I'm afraid this is our territory, and you'll have to pay the toll to pass."
    bd "你胆子不小，这点我承认。不过很遗憾，这里是我们的地盘，你得交过路费才能通过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Toll_Collect_59dc57cf:

    # bd "Nothing much. [bandit_toll] gold and I'll let you go." nointeract
    bd "没什么大不了的。给我 [bandit_toll] 金币，我就放你过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Toll_Collect_de608157:

    # e "Well, I don't want any trouble. Here's [bandit_toll] gold."
    e "我不想惹麻烦。给，这是 [bandit_toll] 金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Toll_Collect_31d284d7:

    # bd "Wise choice. We'll put these gold into good use. Pass now before I change my mind and take you in."
    bd "明智的选择。我们会好好利用这些金币。趁我改变主意、把你抓起来之前，赶紧过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Toll_Collect_f02ad6b5:

    # "The bandit smirks."
    "强盗咧嘴一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Toll_Collect_f7d081f0:

    # e "I won't budge so easily, let's fight then!"
    e "我可不会这么轻易让步，那就打一场吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Toll_Collect_50681a75:

    # bd "Ha, what a dumb decision. Prepare yourself, for when we take you in after this."
    bd "哈，真是愚蠢的决定。做好准备吧，因为打完这场，我们就会把你抓起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite bandits_hideout_loop_e91ba75d:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你找了又找，但周围似乎没有什么值得关注的东西了。"

